# Whole purchase with a simulated decline, shipment and partial return.
as customer alice
cart add SHIRT-BLUE 3
order preview standard home
order place example-place
order pay order-1 3738 card no example-decline "Учебный отказ"
order pay order-1 3738 card yes example-pay
as operator
fulfill start order-1 example-start
fulfill pick order-1 SHIRT-BLUE 3 example-pick
fulfill pack order-1 example-pack
fulfill ship order-1 TRACK-EXAMPLE example-ship
as customer alice
order deliver order-1 example-deliver
return open order-1 example-open SHIRT-BLUE 1 changed-mind
as operator
return inspect return-7 example-inspect SHIRT-BLUE 1 1 1 opened
return complete return-7 example-complete
clock advance 1
report 0 1001
quit
